=== DIAGNOSIS ===
is_anomaly: false
faulty_devices: none
diagnosis_text:
Extensive direct testing found no fault anywhere in the path between Campus 1
(172.16.10/20/30.x) and the rest of the network. Every router in the WAN
(router7, router10, router11, router1) can reach hosts on all three campus
subnets with zero packet loss, and Campus 1 end-hosts (e.g., pc5 at
172.16.10.5, pc12 at 172.16.30.12) can reach WAN destinations. The route
for all three subnets is correctly distributed through OSPF area 0: mswitch0
originates them as directly-connected VLAN SVIs (172.16.10.254/24,
172.16.20.254/24, 172.16.30.254/24), router16 propagates them upstream over
its bond0–eth2 path, and router7 carries them to the rest of the WAN. All
OSPF adjacencies are Full and have been stable for roughly 10 minutes (router7
confirms the router16 neighbour at 172.30.1.1 has been Full for 9m55s).
Router16 shows correct OSPF network statements (10.2.2.0/24 and 172.30.1.0/24
in area 0), IP forwarding enabled, and no iptables rules. The empty
